# NOTE — security hardening (see lib/SECURITY.md):
#  • Login rate limiting and audit logging need no extra env vars.
#  • MFA enforcement is the ADMIN_ENFORCE_MFA flag in lib/auth.ts.
#  • Password policy is configured in the Supabase dashboard
#    (Authentication → Providers → Email), mirrored in lib/auth.ts.
#
# NOTE — Telegram paid-transaction notifications:
#  NOT env vars — stored in the Supabase server settings file so the DB
#  trigger (20260913_telegram_paid_notifications.sql) can read them:
#    ALTER DATABASE postgres SET app.telegram_bot_token = '<token>';
#    ALTER DATABASE postgres SET app.telegram_chat_id  = '<chat id>';
#  Never commit the token anywhere.

